          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रेंगना (reṅgnā) is a tadbhava of Sanskrit riṅgati, \"crawls\" (CDIAL 10739), which lists Hindi rẽgnā. A baby, a snake and a jammed lane of traffic all crawl."
